# QA artifacts (screenshots, smoke scripts, diagnostics)
qa
qa.zip
# ...except the PERMANENT regression guards: they must be committed and
# runnable, or the crash they guard can be reintroduced with no failing
# test. The browser-level invariants (a texture removed while a live
# sprite is bound to it) need a real Phaser runtime, which vitest cannot
# provide — so these scripts are the guard.
!qa/
qa/*
!qa/verify-tier8-bake.mjs
!qa/verify-fault-containment.mjs
!qa/verify-deferred-merge.mjs
!qa/verify-tier8-cycling.mjs
!qa/verify-wall-raise.mjs
!qa/verify-fear-phases.mjs
!qa/verify-gameover-panic.mjs
!qa/verify-fear-in-play.mjs
!qa/lib-game.mjs

